  "subtitle": "walnut and maple syrup tart in sweet shortcrust pastry",
  "excerpt": "A walnut and maple tart fills a blind-baked pastry case with a dark, caramel-sweet maple and egg filling packed with toasted walnuts. It's similar to pecan pie but uses the deeper, more bitter flavour of walnuts against the distinctively earthy sweetness of maple syrup. It slices cleanly when cold and is very rich, serve in small portions.",
