        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Walnut and maple tart is a rich, dark-filling tart that cuts through like a pecan pie, sticky, sweet, and nutty. The walnuts are slightly bitter where pecans are mild, which makes the contrast with the maple more interesting. Toast the walnuts first; it makes a significant difference to the flavour."
